{
    "prompt": "Generate a Knolling-style image. For every suitcase positioned on the top side of the frame, there is a set of items arranged horizontally below it: a cutting board, headphones, a remote, and a screwdriver. The suitcase is visually larger than the cutting board. The screwdriver is located on the right side of the image and is smaller than the remote.",
